description:
Where can I (an AI agent) shop for this product, for my human's country? Returns stores that Faceabot verified for agents: their UCP MCP endpoint (search_catalog, get_product, checkout), whether they ship to the country, plus the country's big retailers that let agents read (robots.txt) and the Shopify cross-store search. Any language.
Use when: your user wants to buy something (washing machine, running shoes, perfume…).
Example: {"query":"washing machine","country":"BE"}
